      "headline": "Anthropic claims Claude proved the Riemann hypothesis",
      "aiSummary": "Anthropic mathematician Levent Alpöge says he used Claude to prove the Riemann hypothesis, and that the proof was formalized in Lean and spans over 250,000 pages. Hours later Stanford researchers published an independent, entirely human competing proof and mathematicians are now checking whether either one holds up."
